id: pm-reliability-window-delivery
title: Add SDK reliability windows and preserve nightly and release-origin recurrence
description: "Reviewed delivery of the public governance reliability primitive, complete original nightly job census with all-state alert and PM repair correlation, enforced nightly threshold artifacts, and independent operator/blocker release-origin series. This delivery completes the nightly measurement acceptance while preserving broader operator follow-up and upstream tag-origin work under the canonical release owner."
type: Changeset
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: release,reliability,sdk
