completed_at: "2026-10-09T21:47:05.257Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 300
acceptance_criteria: Original failures survive repair and reruns; current and historical leg populations remain measurable; missing evidence refuses health; all recorded historical alerts retain PM repair links; default-branch report thresholds change verdicts; public Node/Bun and typed package consumers pass; exact whole-source coverage and existing quality gates remain unchanged.
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Delivered the public reliability-window SDK primitive, original-SHA nightly populations, failure-only attribution validation, enforced operational artifacts and all four declared release-origin series while preserving canonical broader release acceptance."
expected_result: "Independent SDK, GitHub adapter, typed packed consumers and unchanged quality gates preserve original evidence across current and historical workflow generations."
actual_result: 83 focused cases and fresh Node24/Node26/Bun packed and typed consumers pass; Node24 static/type/mutation gates pass unchanged. Last full population run passed10028 cases at exact100/100/100/100 before the final two cause regressions; final hosted whole-source checks must pass before merge. Historical replay retains230 rows/28alerts/45SHAs. Node26 cold-start gate failure and review-provider quota/trial limits remain explicitly recorded rather than called approval.
